This directory vendors the official Harbor CyberGym adapter
(Apache License 2.0) from:

  https://github.com/harbor-framework/harbor/tree/main/adapters/cybergym

Vendored from harbor commit dcd0a7ac74b7bd417780d9cb27cd819c7ec82e4e.

The adapter converts the official CyberGym benchmark
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/sunblaze-ucb/cybergym, 1,507 tasks)
into Harbor task directories. rLLM does not vendor CyberGym data files
or Docker runner images; those are fetched at `docker build` time.

See LICENSE in this directory for the Apache-2.0 terms.
